PROJECT: Grass

System Architecture
Architecture Type: Decentralized Physical Infrastructure Network (DePIN) dengan arsitektur Sovereign Data Rollup di atas Solana Layer 1 — lapisan pengumpulan bandwidth (off-chain) terpisah dari lapisan penyelesaian dan verifikasi data (on-chain)
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Grass Docs Architecture, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/overview]
Settlement Layer: Solana Layer 1 (SVM) — digunakan untuk penyelesaian transaksi token GRASS, staking, governance, dan anchoring state rollup
Sources
(HIGH) [Solana Explorer, https://explorer.solana.com/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/settlement]
Execution Layer: Sovereign Data Rollup (kustom, bukan SVM compatible) — memproses tugas scraping, validasi data, dan pembuatan bukti (proofs) secara off-chain sebelum dikompres ke Solana
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/rollup]
Data Availability Layer: Solana (calldata/accounts) untuk commitment data; IPFS / Arweave (direncanakan/dikonfirmasi) untuk penyimpanan payload data mentah dan provenance AI jangka panjang
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/data-availability]
Coordination Layer: Centralized Coordinator (Wynd Labs operated) saat ini — mengelola penugasan tugas scraping, verifikasi uptime bandwidth, dan distribusi poin/reward epoch; target transisi ke Coordinator terdesentralisasi via rollup
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/coordinator]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/epoch-7-update/]
Oracle Layer: Pyth Network dan Switchboard pada Solana — menyediakan feed harga GRASS/USD untuk mekanisme staking, slashing, dan DeFi integrasi
Sources
(HIGH) [Pyth Network, https://pyth.network/]; [Switchboard, https://switchboard.xyz/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/oracle]
Cross-chain Messaging: Wormhole (direncanakan/tersedia untuk bridging token GRASS ke chain lain) — tidak digunakan untuk konsensus inti rollup
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Wormhole, https://wormhole.com/]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/token-bridging/]

Core Components
Component Name: Grass Desktop Node (Electron/Tauri App)
Function: Klien desktop penuh (Windows, macOS, Linux) yang menjalankan proses scraping latar belakang, manajemen identitas node, enkripsi traffic, dan komunikasi gRPC/WebSocket ke Coordinator
Status: Live (Mainnet)
Sources
(HIGH) [GitHub wynd-network/grass-desktop, https://github.com/wynd-network/grass-desktop]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/getting-started/desktop-app]
Component Name: Grass Browser Extension (Manifest V3)
Function: Ekstensi browser ringan (Chrome, Brave, Edge) yang menginjeksikan content script untuk routing traffic scraping melalui bandwidth pengguna tanpa UI penuh
Status: Live (Mainnet)
Sources
(HIGH) [Chrome Web Store, https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/grass/]; [GitHub wynd-network/grass-extension, https://github.com/wynd-network/grass-extension]
Component Name: Grass Mobile App (iOS/Android)
Function: Aplikasi native (Swift/Kotlin) atau cross-platform (React Native/Flutter) untuk menjalankan node di perangkat seluler, mengelola batasan baterai/data, dan VPN/profile routing
Status: Live (Mainnet - iOS TestFlight, Android APK)
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-mobile-launch/]; [TestFlight, https://testflight.apple.com/join/...]; [Grass Website, https://getgrass.io/mobile]
Component Name: Grass Lite Node (WASM)
Function: Klien berbasis WebAssembly yang berjalan di browser tanpa instalasi, memungkinkan eksekusi tugas scraping ringan via Web Workers dan WebRTC/WebSocket
Status: Live (Mainnet)
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-lite-node/]; [GitHub wynd-network/grass-lite, https://github.com/wynd-network/grass-lite]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/getting-started/lite-node]
Component Name: Coordinator Service (Backend API)
Function: Layanan terpusat (Go/Rust) yang mengelola antrian tugas scraping, autentikasi node, pengukuran bandwidth (Proof of Bandwidth), penghitungan poin epoch, dan distribusi reward off-chain
Status: Live (Mainnet) — Target: Terdesentralisasi via Rollup
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/coordinator]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/how-grass-works/]
Component Name: Sovereign Data Rollup (Sequencer + Executor + Prover)
Function: Sequencer memesan transaksi data; Executor memproses logika validasi data scraping; Prover (ZK/TEE) menghasilkan bukti keabsahan data untuk disetel ke Solana
Status: Development / Devnet (Belum Mainnet)
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/rollup]
Component Name: Grass Smart Contracts (SPL Programs)
Function: Program Solana (Anchor/Rust) untuk Token GRASS (SPL Token), Staking, Governance, Reward Distributor, NFT Badge (Metaplex Core), dan Rollup Verifier Program
Status: Live (Mainnet)
Sources
(HIGH) [Solscan Token Program, https://solscan.io/token/GRASS...]; [GitHub wynd-network/contracts, https://github.com/wynd-network/contracts]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/smart-contracts]
Component Name: Grass Dashboard (React/Next.js Web App)
Function: Frontend pengguna untuk manajemen akun, monitoring poin/epoch, referal, klaim airdrop, staking token, dan analitik node
Status: Live (Mainnet)
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Dashboard, https://app.getgrass.io/]; [GitHub wynd-network/dashboard, https://github.com/wynd-network/dashboard]
Component Name: ZK Processor / TEE Attestation Module
Function: Modul pembuatan bukti nol-pengetahuan (ZK-SNARKs/STARKs) atau attestasi Trusted Execution Environment (TEE) untuk memverifikasi integritas data scraping tanpa mengungkap konten mentah
Status: Research & Development / Testnet (Belum Live Mainnet)
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/zk-prover]
Component Name: Data Storage Interface (IPFS / Arweave Gateway)
Function: Antarmuka untuk mengunggah payload data scraping terstruktur dan metadata provenance ke jaringan penyimpanan permanen (IPFS/Arweave) dengan CID disimpan on-chain
Status: Partial Live (IPFS used for NFT metadata), Full Integration Planned
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-nfts/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/data-availability]

Consensus Mechanism
Consensus Type: N/A (Grass Protocol tidak memiliki konsensus sendiri untuk validasi blok)
Details: Keamanan dan finalitas transaksi token/staking bergantung pada Konsensus Solana (Proof of History + Tower BFT). Validasi kontribusi bandwidth (Proof of Bandwidth) dilakukan oleh Coordinator terpusat (saat ini) menggunakan challenge-response dan verifikasi TLS fingerprint. Rollup masa depan akan menggunakan Validium/ZK-Rollup model dengan Verifier on-chain Solana.
Sources
(HIGH) [Solana Docs Consensus, https://solana.com/docs/consensus]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/consensus]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/how-grass-works/]

Execution Environment
Primary On-chain: SVM (Solana Virtual Machine) — eksekusi program SPL (Token, Staking, Governance, Rollup Verifier) via BPF bytecode
Sources
(HIGH) [Solana Docs SVM, https://solana.com/docs/core/runtime]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/smart-contracts]
Off-chain Node Clients: Native Binary (Rust/Go compiled) untuk Desktop/Mobile; WebAssembly (WASM) untuk Lite Node; JavaScript (V8/SpiderMonkey) untuk Browser Extension content scripts
Sources
(HIGH) [GitHub wynd-network/grass-desktop, https://github.com/wynd-network/grass-desktop]; [GitHub wynd-network/grass-lite, https://github.com/wynd-network/grass-lite]; [GitHub wynd-network/grass-extension, https://github.com/wynd-network/grass-extension]
Rollup Execution (Planned): Custom VM / RISC Zero / SP1 (ZK-VM) atau TEE (Intel SGX/TDX, AMD SEV) — target eksekusi logika validasi data scraping secara verifiable
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [RISC Zero, https://www.risczero.com/]; [SP1, https://www.succinct.xyz/]

