Security Model
Model: Multi-layer Security
Layer 1: Solana Validator Set (PoS) — Finalitas transaksi token, staking, governance, dan verifikasi rollup proof
Sources
(HIGH) [Solana Docs Security, https://solana.com/docs/consensus]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/security]
Layer 2: Smart Contract Audits — Halborn (Smart Contracts, Staking, Token), Kudelski Security (Infrastructure, Node Client) — Temuan kritis/tinggi diremediasi sebelum TGE
Sources
(HIGH) [Halborn Audit, https://www.halborn.com/audits/grass]; [Kudelski Security, https://www.kudelskisecurity.com/]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/security-audit/]
Layer 3: Coordinator Trust Assumption (Current) — Coordinator terpusat (Wynd Labs) mengelola penugasan tugas dan perhitungan reward; risiko sensor/single point of failure diminimalkan dengan transparansi epoch dan rencana deskentralisasi via Rollup
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/coordinator]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/decentralization-roadmap/]
Layer 4: Node Client Security — Sandbox eksekusi scraping (isolasi proses), Enkripsi TLS end-to-end untuk traffic scraping, Verifikasi integritas binary (code signing Apple/Windows, Chrome Web Store review)
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/node-security/]; [Chrome Web Store Policy, https://developer.chrome.com/docs/webstore/program-policies/]; [Apple Notarization, https://developer.apple.com/macos/notarization/]
Layer 5: Rollup Verification (Future) — ZK Proofs (RISC Zero/SP1) atau TEE Attestation (Intel TDX/AMD SEV) untuk memvalidasi keabsahan data scraping tanpa kepercayaan pada Coordinator
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [RISC Zero, https://www.risczero.com/]; [Intel TDX, https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/developer/tools/trust-domain-extensions/overview.html]
Layer 6: Multi-sig Treasury — Grass Foundation treasury dikendalikan multi-sig (Squads/Safe) dengan threshold signing untuk pengeluaran dana ekosistem
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/introducing-grass-foundation/]; [Solscan Treasury Address, https://solscan.io/account/...]; [Squads Protocol, https://squads.so/]
Layer 7: Bug Bounty Program — Program bug bounty resmi di platform (Immunefi/HackerOne) untuk smart contract dan infrastruktur kritis
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Immunefi Grass, https://immunefi.com/bounty/grass/]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/bug-bounty/]

