Known Technical Limitations
Limitation 1: Ketergantungan Coordinator Terpusat — Saat ini penugasan tugas scraping, verifikasi bandwidth, dan perhitungan reward sepenuhnya dikelola server Wynd Labs; risiko downtime, sensor, dan manipulasi poin ada hingga Rollup live
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/coordinator]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/decentralization-roadmap/]
Limitation 2: Skalabilitas Verifikasi Bandwidth — Mekanisme Proof of Bandwidth saat ini membutuhkan round-trip ke Coordinator untuk challenge-response; bottleneck throughput pada jumlah node > jutaan (target 10M+ nodes) memerlukan arsitektur Rollup/Verifiable Delay Function (VDF) baru
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/scaling]
Limitation 3: Keterbatasan Lite Node (WASM) — Performa scraping terbatas oleh sandbox browser (CPU single-thread Web Worker, memory limit ~2-4GB, tidak bisa raw socket/TCP/UDP hanya WebSocket/WebRTC); tidak cocok untuk tugas scraping berat/parser kompleks
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/getting-started/lite-node]; [MDN Web Workers, https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API]; [WebAssembly Spec]
Limitation 4: Mobile OS Restrictions — iOS Network Extension / VPN API memiliki batasan throughput, background execution time, dan memerlukan izin pengguna eksplisit; Android foreground service notification wajib; mengurangi uptime efektif node mobile vs desktop
Sources
(HIGH) [Apple NetworkExtension Docs, https://developer.apple.com/documentation/networkextension]; [Android Foreground Service Docs, https://developer.android.com/guide/components/foreground-services]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-mobile-launch/]
Limitation 5: Biaya & Latensi Solana L1 untuk Rollup Settlement — Setiap batch rollup memerlukan transaksi Solana (compute units & rent); biaya fluktuatif dan block time 400ms memengaruhi finalitas data AI real-time; solusi: kompresi data maksimal dan batching besar
Sources
(HIGH) [Solana Docs Fees, https://solana.com/docs/core/fees]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]
Limitation 6: Ketergantungan RPC Eksternal (Helius/Triton) — Ketersediaan dan latency RPC memengaruhi performa Dashboard, Indexer, dan Sequencer Rollup; single point of failure jika provider utama down (mitigasi: multi-provider fallback)
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Helius Status Page, https://status.helius.dev/]; [Triton Status, https://status.triton.one/]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/infrastructure-partners/]
Limitation 7: Belum Ada Bukti Formal (ZK/TEE) di Mainnet — Verifikasi integritas data scraping saat ini "Trusted Coordinator"; ZK Prover (RISC Zero/SP1) dan TEE Attestation masih tahap R&D/Devnet; belum terbukti biaya komputasi (proving time/cost) untuk volume data skala internet
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [RISC Zero Benchmarks, https://www.risczero.com/benchmarks]; [SP1 Benchmarks, https://www.succinct.xyz/benchmarks]

